OL,3,AMan jailed after threatening to kill
OL,4,Ason's teacher in French village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been given a six-month jail
OL,7,Fterm in France after he threatened to
OL,8,Fbehead a female primary school teacher
OL,9,Fwho had disciplined his son at a
OL,10,Fvillage primary school.
OL,12,FThe 47-year-old was sentenced after a
OL,13,Ffast-track hearing on Thursday, six
OL,14,Fdays after the events unfolded in Le
OL,15,FFauga, a village with a population of
OL,16,Fabout 2,600 just outside the
OL,17,Fsouthwestern city of Toulouse.
OL,19,FThe teacher has been granted official
OL,20,Fprotection and has gone on sick leave.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
