OL,3,AMan jailed after threatening to kill
OL,4,Ason's teacher in French village
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench Education Minister Edouard
OL,7,FGeffray said: "No teacher should be
OL,8,Fafraid to do their job. Attacking one
OL,9,Fof them is attacking the entire
OL,10,Finstitution."
